      zone z38-hard-1 asset concert-bass-drum-60-hard-1 keys C2 E2 velocity 0.65 1 root D2
      zone z43-hard-1 asset concert-bass-drum-60-hard-1 keys F2 A2 velocity 0.65 1 root G2
